@Feedback.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5111

### POST-1 valid -> 200, id 1
POST {{Feedback.Api_HostAddress}}/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Great","rating":5}

### POST-1 empty message -> 400
POST {{Feedback.Api_HostAddress}}/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"","rating":3}

### POST-1 rating out of range -> 400
POST {{Feedback.Api_HostAddress}}/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Ok","rating":9}

### POST-1 wrong content type -> 415
POST {{Feedback.Api_HostAddress}}/api/feedback
Content-Type: text/plain

not json
